---
interface Props { lang: 'fr' | 'en'; figure: 1 | 2 | 3; }
const { lang, figure } = Astro.props;
---

{lang === 'fr' && figure === 1 && (
<figure class="commerce-figure">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 360" width="100%" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="traces01-fr-contrat-title traces01-fr-contrat-desc" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">
<title id="traces01-fr-contrat-title">Deux paiements distincts</title>
<desc id="traces01-fr-contrat-desc">Contrat du 26 janvier 2022. Life360 accorde à Placer un droit d’exploitation de données agrégées contre paiement. Placer fournit des services à Life360 contre un autre paiement. Les montants sont occultés.</desc>
<rect x="0" y="0" width="480" height="360" fill="#0c0e10"/>
<text x="20" y="32" font-size="24" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Deux paiements distincts</text>
<text x="20" y="62" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Accord du 26 janvier 2022</text>
<text x="20" y="108" font-size="24" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Life360</text>
<text x="460" y="108" font-size="24" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="500" text-anchor="end">Placer</text>
<text x="240" y="133" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="middle">Droit d’exploitation des données</text>
<line x1="56" y1="146" x2="424" y2="146" stroke="#b8c8db" stroke-width="1.5"/><polyline points="418,142 424,146 418,150" fill="none" stroke="#b8c8db" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
<text x="240" y="185" font-size="21" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="400" text-anchor="middle">Paiement à Life360</text>
<line x1="424" y1="198" x2="56" y2="198" stroke="#72e5df" stroke-width="1.5"/><polyline points="62,194 56,198 62,202" fill="none" stroke="#72e5df" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
<text x="240" y="247" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="middle">Services de traitement</text>
<line x1="424" y1="260" x2="56" y2="260" stroke="#b8c8db" stroke-width="1.5"/><polyline points="62,256 56,260 62,264" fill="none" stroke="#b8c8db" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
<text x="240" y="299" font-size="21" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="400" text-anchor="middle">Paiement à Placer</text>
<line x1="56" y1="312" x2="424" y2="312" stroke="#72e5df" stroke-width="1.5"/><polyline points="418,308 424,312 418,316" fill="none" stroke="#72e5df" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
<line x1="20" y1="226" x2="460" y2="226" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="346" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Montants occultés dans le contrat</text>
</svg>
<figcaption><strong>Deux contreparties, deux rémunérations.</strong> Sens des droits, services et paiements prévus par le contrat du 26 janvier 2022. Ni le montant ni le solde effectivement réglé ne sont établis ici. Les flèches ne représentent pas des volumes. Sources : <a href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1581760/000119312522172365/d328928dex1013.htm">[1]</a> <a href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1581760/000158176024000006/exhibit1012amendmentno1tod.htm">[2]</a>.</figcaption>
</figure>
)}

{lang === 'fr' && figure === 2 && (
<figure class="commerce-figure">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 350" width="100%" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="traces01-fr-revenus-title traces01-fr-revenus-desc" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">
